  <dashboards>
    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Key Business Insights'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='860' maxwidth='650' minheight='560' minwidth='420' />
      <zones>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='50000' id='3' type-v2='text' w='56154' x='5692' y='3671'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='15'>KEY BUSINESS INSIGHTS</run>
            <run>

• Technology has the highest sales and profit among the three categories.
• Furniture has substantial sales but much lower profit than the other categories.
• The West region has the highest sales, while the South region has the lowest.
•</run>
            <run bold='true'>Æ </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>“The Consumer segment generates the highest sales.” </run>
            <run>
. Sales increased strongly from 2012 to 2014.
• </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>“Canon imageCLASS 2200 is the top-selling product among the Top 10 products.”</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='50000' id='4' type-v2='text' w='65077' x='30308' y='49301'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>Key Takeaways</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Technology</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> generated the highest sales (</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>836,154</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>) and highest profit (</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>145,455</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>) among the three categories. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Furniture</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> generated substantial sales (</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>742,000</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>) but comparatively low profit (</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>18,451</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>), indicating lower profitability. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>West region</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> recorded the highest sales (</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>725,458</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>), while the </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>South region</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> had the lowest (</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>391,722</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>). </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Consumer segment</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> generated the highest sales (</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>1,161,401</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>), followed by Corporate and Home Office. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Overall sales showed a </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>strong upward trend from 2012 to 2014</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Canon imageCLASS 2200</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> was the top-selling product among the Top 10 products, with sales of </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>61,600</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
