                <story-points>
                  <story-point caption='Overall Sales Performance&#10;The dashboard provides an overview of total sales, profit, quantity, and category-level performance.' captured-sheet='Sales Performance dashboard' id='1' />
                  <story-point caption='Sales Performance Analysis&#10;Sales increased over time, with the West region and Consumer segment showing strong sales performance. The Top 10 products highlight the products contributing most to sales.' captured-sheet='Sales Performance Analysis' id='2' />
                  <story-point caption='Key Business Insights&#10;Technology leads in both sales and profit, while Furniture shows comparatively low profitability. Regional and segment-level differences provide opportunities for further business improvement.' captured-sheet='Key Business Insights' id='3' />
